  "_comment": [
    "Rules for build-terminology.py. `rules` are applied in order to every msgid;",
    "each `from` is matched as a whole word, case-insensitively, and the case of",
    "the match is transferred to `to` (ALL CAPS, all lower, otherwise sentence case).",
    "`overrides` replace a msgid outright, `exclusions` switch off named rules for",
    "one msgid, and `skip` leaves a msgid out of the pack entirely."
